---
source: tests/compiler_snapshots.rs
expression: "project.ok(&[\"--help\"])?"
---
Generate native tool configuration from Pkl

Usage: confset [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init      Create a starter configuration, preserving an existing file
  generate  Create or update native configuration files
  validate  Evaluate and compile without writing generated configuration files
  list      List configured outputs, formats, and ownership status
  clean     Remove unmodified generated files using ownership records

Options:
      --config <FILE>  Select a Pkl file instead of normal configuration discovery
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
